OL,3,ANepal-Tibet flood deaths jump to 626 as
OL,4,Asearch for survivors enters fourth day
OL,5,
OL,6,FWe are relying on reports from Chinese
OL,7,Fstate media about the situation in
OL,8,FTibet - our China correspondent
OL,9,Fexplains why
OL,11,FSpeaking to the BBC from south London,
OL,12,FPrajval Haldia says he is "hoping and
OL,13,Freally praying" for the return of his
OL,14,Fparents, who were in the area when the
OL,15,Ffloods hit
OL,17,FA collapsed glacier caused the huge
OL,18,Fflood wave, local officials tell the
OL,19,FBBC. The surge tore through houses and
OL,20,Froads, and destroyed a key Nepal-Tibet
OL,21,Fborder crossing
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
